contentText:
Rick Ross is unbeatable in Madden &#8212; at least according to him.

The Miami rapper and businessman was recently on an episode of the Complex collectibles show On Display , where he showed off his car, motorcycle and video game collection that he stores in his $50 million Miami airplane hangar.

